  "description": "<p>This custom anchor doormat adds a unique nautical touch to any space, perfect for boat owners and marine enthusiasts. It allows for personalization with a boat name or family name, creating a one-of-a-kind welcome for cabins, ships, or docks. The design features vibrant maritime colors and an anchor motif, blending style with practical use in high-traffic areas.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat name or family name for a unique welcome.</li>\n<li>Stylish nautical design with vibrant maritime colors and anchor motifs.</li>\n<li>Crafted for durability and comfort with a soft feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Features anti-slip pads for secure placement on any surface.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain, suitable for high-traffic areas.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Anchor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester, Memory Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe with a damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is ideal for enhancing the entrance of cabins, yachts, fishing boats, or dockside areas. Its durable construction makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings, including marina entries and coastal homes.</p>",
